	"identifying_description": "Pair of tabs from same mantle border, each tab creates a head (one green, one red)with eyes and mouth. each head is topped with a geometrically patterned turban and has a long brown fringe suggesting hair or beard. Plain-weave cotton embroiderd with camelid-fiber, cross knit looping of camelid-fiber and camelid-fiber fringe.",
